  m_text: "Poses As\r\nA phishing email may pretend to be someone you trust, such
    as your manager, a coworker, your bank, a delivery company, or another well known
    organisation.\r\n\r\nWhat to do:  \nDo not trust the sender right away. Check
    the full email address and look at how the message is written. If something feels
    strange or unexpected, contact the person or organisation through their real
    website or phone number. If the email pressures you to act quickly or pretends
    to be someone else, report it and do not continue."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 908bf12b09d599749960f1eeb3588c02, type: 2}
