  m_text: "Generic Greeting\r\nMessages like \u201CDear user\u201D or \u201CDear
    customer\u201D can be a sign that the sender does not really know who you are.\r\n\r\nWhat
    to do: \nSlow down and look for more warning signs before taking any action.
    If the email also asks you to click, download, or share information, treat it
    as suspicious and report it. "
