  m_text: "Sender Domain\r\nA phishing email may use a display name that looks real,
    while the full address is wrong or slightly changed.\r\n\r\nWhat to do: \nOpen
    the sender details and inspect the full email address. If the domain looks unusual,
    do not trust the email. Instead, contact the company or person through an official
    channel you find yourself. Report the email if it looks spoofed. "
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 908bf12b09d599749960f1eeb3588c02, type: 2}
