  m_text: "Error\r\nIf an email has strange spelling, bad grammar, or unusual formatting,
    treat it as a warning sign. Errors can also include strange symbols or broken
    text (for example: Hello, {Boss}).\n\r\nWhat to do: \nDo not click the link,
    do not open attachments, and do not reply. Check the message through the company\u2019s
    real website, app, or phone number. If you are at work, report it to your IT
    or security contact"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 908bf12b09d599749960f1eeb3588c02, type: 2}
