  m_text: "Logo Imitation\r\nA fake email may copy a company logo, colors, or layout
    to look trustworthy.\r\n\r\nWhat to do: \nDo not trust branding by itself. Compare
    the sender address, link destination, and writing style. If the logo looks old,
    blurry, or slightly wrong, verify the message through the real website and report
    the email."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 908bf12b09d599749960f1eeb3588c02, type: 2}
