      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "Urgency\r\nThe phishing mails contain a sense of urgency, this can be
    done through short deadlines, a sense of panic or language using words such as:
    \u201CAct now\u201D, \u201CYour account will be closed\u201D, or \u201CImmediate
    action required\u201D.\r\n\r\nWhat to do: \r\nDo not act under pressure. Pause,
    open the real website or app yourself, and check whether there is actually a
    problem. If the message pushes you to rush, report it instead of reacting emotionally.\r\n"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 908bf12b09d599749960f1eeb3588c02, type: 2}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: 7923541554164843301, guid: 908bf12b09d599749960f1eeb3588c02, type: 2}
