  m_text: "Request Info\r\nIf an email asks for passwords, codes, bank details, ID
    details, or other sensitive information, that is a major warning sign.\r\n\r\nWhat
    to do: \nNever send sensitive information through that email. Stop the interaction,
    verify the request through official support, and report the message. If you already
    responded, contact the real organization right away."
