  m_text: "No Branding\r\nSome phishing emails look plain, incomplete, or unprofessional.\r\n\r\nWhat
    to do: \nAsk whether a real message from that company would normally include
    branding, contact details, or a proper signature. If expected details are missing,
    do not interact with the email. Report it if it appears suspicious."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
